<main class="content narrow onboarding-page"><section class="card onboarding-card"><span class="settings-kicker">FOR YOU</span><h1>Nimalar sizga qiziq?</h1><p class="muted">5–8 ta mavzu tanlasangiz, yangi akkauntda ham feed tezroq moslashadi. Keyin Sozlamalar orqali istalgan payt o‘zgartirasiz.</p><%if(error){%><div class="alert"><%=error%></div><%}%><form method="post" action="/onboarding/interests"><input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%=next%>"><div class="interest-grid"><%options.forEach(o=>{%><label class="interest-chip"><input type="checkbox" name="interests" value="<%=o.key%>" <%=(selected||[]).includes(o.key)?'checked':''%>><span><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i><%=o.label%></span></label><%})%></div><div class="onboarding-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Davom etish</button><a class="btn ghost" href="<%=next%>">Hozircha o‘tkazib yuborish</a></div></form><p class="muted tiny">Lumi bu tanlovlardan faqat feed personalizatsiyasi uchun foydalanadi; sog‘liq, din, siyosiy qarash yoki boshqa sezgir xususiyatlar infer qilinmaydi.</p></section></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
